[tr][td]block archive: append a 1 MB block ([tt]WriteBlockBench[/tt])[/td][td]422 us[/td][td]143 us[/td][td][b]3.0x faster[/b][/td][td]block 413,567, the same block appended each op on both sides[/td][/tr]
